[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（２８３プロダクションに入社して数か月……\r\nいよいよ俺が、アイドルをプロデュースする時が来た）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bg": "00001",
    "bgm": "001"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（ずっと憧れていた仕事をようやく任されたんだ、\r\nこれから精一杯頑張るぞ！）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おはようございます！\r\nって、天井社長……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010010,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "おはよう、お前を待っていたぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1902001010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（この２８３プロダクションを束ねる\r\n天井社長……あいかわらずダンディな雰囲気だ）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010020,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "お前には今日から、アイドルを\r\nプロデュースしてもらうと伝えていたが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1902001010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010030,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "素晴らしい結果を期待させてもらう\r\n私は甘くないぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1902001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "は、はい！　よろしくお願いします！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010040,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "よろしい。では、仕事の説明ははづきに任せて……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1902001010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "？　はづきさんはどこにも……あっ！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（そ、ソファの裏で誰かが倒れてる！？）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010010,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "……ふわぁ～？\r\nなんですか～急に大きな声出して～……",
    "charAnim1": "sleep1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "charType": "sub_characters",
    "charId": "staff",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1901001010010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010050,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "は、はづき……なぜ床で寝ているんだ",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1902001010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010020,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "すみません、ソファへ着く前に\r\n眠気に負けてしまいまして～……",
    "charAnim1": "sleep2",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1901001010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010060,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "せっかくまじめな雰囲気を出したというのに……",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1902001010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010070,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "……ともかく！\r\n彼に仕事の説明をしてくれ",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1902001010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010030,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "はい、もちろんです\r\nプロデューサーさん、どうぞ～",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1901001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとうございます\r\n……あいかわらず、わかりやすくまとまってますね、資料",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（はづきさん、こういうところは頼れるんだよな……）",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010040,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ありがとうございます\r\nそれじゃあ、さっそくお仕事の説明に入りますね～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1901001010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010050,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "まず、今回のプロデュースの目標についてですが……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1901001010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010060,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ワンダーアイドルノヴァ・グランプリ……\r\n通称『W.I.N.G.』への出場を目指してください",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1901001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『W.I.N.G.』……ですか",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010070,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "はい\r\n新人アイドルの祭典とも言われる、すごいライブなんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1901001010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010080,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "祭典と言われるだけあって、この『W.I.N.G.』は\r\n出場資格を手に入れるまでが厳しいんです……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1901001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010090,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "エントリーしたアイドルは開催前まで、\r\n全４回のシーズンごとに審査を受けます",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1901001010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010100,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "その時、一定のランクに達していないと、\r\n出場資格を失ってしまうんです",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1901001010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010110,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ですので、精一杯頑張っていきましょ～！\r\n私もたくさんサポートさせていただきますね～",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1901001010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010080,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "……少しアドバイスをしておくが、\r\nお前は、２８３プロダクションのプロデューサーだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1902001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010090,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "担当アイドルと他のアイドルたちを\r\n交流させることも重要になってくる",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1902001010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010100,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "互いに影響しあうことで目指せる高みもあるだろう",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1902001010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010110,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "まあ、まずは思うようにやってみるといい\r\n結果がついてくるかは、お前とアイドルの頑張り次第だ",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1902001010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010120,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "では、そろそろお仕事に移ってもらいましょうか\r\n今回プロデュースするアイドルは──",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1901001010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010190,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "今日事務所に来ている子から選んでください\r\nこの間のオーディションに受かった子たちがいますから",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1901001010190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010200,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "新しいユニットのメンバーのうちの\r\nひとりになってもらう予定なんですよ",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1901001010200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうなんですね、わかりました",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "black2",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
      "width": 1136,
      "height": 640,
      "color": "000000"
    },
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "from",
      "x": 1000,
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000
    }
  },
  {
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "effectLabel": "black2",
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000,
      "easing": "easeInQuart"
    }
  },
  {
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（ん？　あの二つ結びの子……\r\nなんだかこっちを見てるような……）",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "010",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001010010,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……あっ！　あの時の！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1010001010010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001010020,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "あのっ、私のこと覚えてますか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1010001010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え、ええと……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（この子、見覚えがあるな……たしか……\r\n……そうだ！）",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "オーディションに参加してくれてた、\r\n園田智代子さんだね",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001010030,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "はい！　そうです！　\r\n覚えててもらえて嬉しいですっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1010001010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001010040,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "あの時は、すごくお世話になって……！\r\nありがとうございました！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1010001010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001010050,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "私、これから頑張りますねっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1010001010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001010060,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……って言っても、\r\nデビューはまだまだ先だと思いますけど……えへへ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1010001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（園田さんの笑顔……素朴だけどすごく可愛いな\r\nこの親しみやすさはきっと武器になる）",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……園田さん、良かったら\r\n俺がプロデュースするユニットの一員になってくれないか？",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001010070,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "えぇっ！？\r\n私がですかっ？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1010001010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "園田さんの笑顔を見たら\r\nどうしても誘いたい、って思ったんだ",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "急な話かもしれないけど、どうかな？",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001010080,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "で、でもでも、本当に私でいいんですか？\r\n私、全然普通で……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1010001010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "普通なんてことはない\r\n持っているものを活かしてくれればいいんだ",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001010090,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "持っているもの……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1010001010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "園田さんについて、教えてくれないか？",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001010100,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "わかりました！\r\nえっと、えーっと……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1010001010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001010110,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "私は園田智代子で、女子高生で、\r\n友達からはチョコって呼ばれてて、",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1010001010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "チョコ？",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001010120,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "はい！　名前が智代子で、チョコって読めるので、\r\nそういうあだ名が……ん？　チョコ……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1010001010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001010130,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "チョコアイドル、園田智代子！\r\n……なんてどうでしょうか？！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1010001010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001010140,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "私、甘いもの好きですし、ぴったりな気がします！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000101/1010001010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな。いいんじゃないか、チョコアイドル！",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001010150,
